WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Prepare for the job you want using your real resume and the real job description.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Open your Interview Proof Pack and start with the two documents that matter.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
Upload your resume or paste the experience you can truthfully discuss.

00:15.000 --> 00:21.000
Add the job description, then set the interview stage and expected duration.

00:21.000 --> 00:27.000
Generate a transparent evidence map showing strong proof, partial proof, and real gaps.

00:27.000 --> 00:33.000
Turn your strongest evidence into interview stories you can explain and defend.

00:33.000 --> 00:39.000
Prepare role-specific questions ranked by stage, duration, evidence, and gaps.

00:39.000 --> 00:44.000
Enter the Mock Interview Studio and choose the interviewer role.

00:44.000 --> 00:49.000
Answer by typing or voice while the interviewer follows a clear story spine.

00:49.000 --> 00:55.000
Get specific coaching, evidence-grounded scores, and the next follow-up question.
